## 4. 核心資料模型

### 4.1 Discovery DAG
```python
@dataclass
class TreeNode:
    node_id: str
    task_id: str
    parent_id: str | None
    policy_version: str
    action_type: str              # expand / mutate / prune / tool_call
    tool_name: str | None
    tool_input: dict
    prompt_mutation: dict | None
    llm_response: str | None
    output_result: Any
    sandbox_exit_code: int | None
    stdout: str | None
    stderr: str | None
    score: float
    token_cost: int
    exec_time_ms: float
    critical_path_ms: float | None
    created_at: float
```

### 4.2 資料表建議
- `tasks(task_id, goal, budget, status)`
- `nodes(node_id, task_id, parent_id, ... , score, token_cost, exec_time_ms)`
- `edges(parent_id, child_id)`
- `policies(policy_id, version, code_hash, parent_version, score, status)`
- `evaluations(eval_id, policy_id, q_norm, c_norm, p_norm, miss_rate, final_score, passed)`
- `tools(tool_id, name, schema_json, code, tests, version, enabled)`

儲存可用 SQLite/Postgres + JSONB。DAG 查詢需索引 `task_id, parent_id, policy_version`。

